# Test run artifacts. Beyond being build output, a .trx embeds base64 blobs that the
# gitleaks `square-access-token` rule matches — committing one fails the secret gate
# on a false positive and buries any real finding in the noise.
backend-dotnet/**/TestResults/
*.trx
